<title>AUSTRALIA: Cricket-Sheffield Shield score.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Sheffield Shield score.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play score in the Sheffield Shield competition on Wednesday:</p>
<p>In Brisbane (first day): Tasmania first innings 14 for one v Queensland - only 30 minutes play was possible due to rain.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
